WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.812
Epictetus opens his little handbook with one simple split.

2
00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:07.369
Of things, some are in our

3
00:00:07.369 --> 00:00:09.292
power, and others are not.

4
00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:12.465
Your opinions, intentions, desires and

5
00:00:12.465 --> 00:00:14.388
choices are yours to direct.

6
00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:17.081
Your body, possessions, reputation and job title

7
00:00:17.081 --> 00:00:19.773
can be influenced, but never fully controlled.

8
00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:24.100
Most stress comes from treating the second group

9
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.792
as if it belonged in the first:

10
00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:29.869
needing the promotion, the praise, the perfect outcome.

11
00:00:31.119 --> 00:00:34.196
So put your effort where your control is

12
00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:37.273
real, like preparation, honesty and how you respond,

13
00:00:37.273 --> 00:00:39.581
and hold everything else more loosely.

14
00:00:40.831 --> 00:00:44.292
Take one worry and split it into two columns:

15
00:00:44.292 --> 00:00:46.985
what I control, and what I don't.

16
00:00:46.985 --> 00:00:48.908
Then act on one item

17
00:00:48.908 --> 00:00:50.831
from the first column today.
